# Liquid URLs

Production `baseurl` is `/site`. Hardcoded `/public/...` and `../public/...` break in prod or locally depending on depth.

```liquid
{{ 'public/uploads/2026/09/example.png' | relative_url }}
{{ post.url | relative_url }}
<a href="{{ '/contact/' | relative_url }}">Contact</a>
```

- Lightbox / full-page assets: `data-magnific-image` and `data-no-swup`.
- Prefer `| relative_url` on new markup even if a nearby page uses a raw relative path.
- Never put `https://gervisbermudez.github.io` in templates; `site.url` + `site.baseurl` already do that in `_includes/head.html`.
